==Explanation==
The Battle Cats app will go into '''Recovery Mode''' when the player changes the date/time on their device or travels to a different time zone. In recovery mode, players can't access [[Special Events]] or the [[Cat Capsule]]. This mode is a common side effect of returning from a further time zone and generally lasts as long as you traveled forwards. To solve it: subtract 2 days from your device, enter the game, wait a few seconds, then enable automatic time and reenter the game.

